WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.540
If I see a situation pointing south I can't ignore it

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.480
You'll just make it worse

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.000
Does that mean you're going to arrest me?

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:20.740
That's why I'm here

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.020
We need to be put in check

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:25.840
Last warning

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:27.300
I can do this all day

